              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "काष्ठम् — kāṣṭham — \"firewood; a piece of wood\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माता चुल्ल्यां काष्ठं स्थापयति। mātā cullyāṃ kāṣṭhaṃ sthāpayati. Mother puts firewood in the stove."
            },
