              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "काष्ठम् (kāṣṭham) is the word MW records for a piece of wood, timber, a stick; MW gives no derivation, so its origin is uncertain (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
